sequenceDiagram

    title Sprint 4 Sensor-to-Userspace Timing

    participant IMU as MPU-9250
    participant STM as STM32
    participant DRDY as DATA_READY
    participant IRQ as Jetson IRQ
    participant WQ as Workqueue
    participant SPI as SPI Master
    participant USER as Userspace

    Note over IMU,STM: Sensor sample becomes available

    IMU->>STM: Sensor data ready
    STM->>IMU: Read sensor registers
    IMU-->>STM: Accelerometer + Gyroscope data

    Note over STM: Packet construction

    STM->>DRDY: DATA_READY HIGH

    DRDY->>IRQ: Rising edge
    IRQ->>WQ: schedule_work()
    WQ->>SPI: Begin SPI transfer

    Note over SPI,STM: 36-byte packet transfer

    SPI->>STM: Clock packet
    STM-->>SPI: Shift telemetry bytes

    SPI-->>WQ: Transfer complete

    WQ->>USER: Packet becomes available
    USER->>USER: Decode and log

    Note over IMU,USER: Measure actual delays during Sprint 4 testing
